    "body": "# What does this PR do ?\r\n\r\nSupport NVCRE init containers for llmb K8s workloads\r\n\r\n# Changelog\r\n\r\nAdded --nvcre_init_containers_json, forwarded to NvcreExecutor.init_containers, and\r\n--nvcre_bridge_root (default /opt/Megatron-Bridge) so the generated command and\r\nPYTHONPATH can use a Megatron-Bridge checkout that an init container placed in the\r\npod instead of the image's copy.",
